<title>USA: INSIGHT -DLR NESTLED IN NEW LOWER RANGES NEAR-TERM.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT -DLR NESTLED IN NEW LOWER RANGES NEAR-TERM.</headline>
<text>
<p>DLR* *S/TERM RANGE  *SUPPORT *RESTNCE *RSI-14 *MA-8   *MA-13</p>
<p>DEM* *1.8390/1.8650 *1.8455  *1.8605  *64 pct *1.8621 *1.8522</p>
<p>YEN* *114.70/117.00 *115.00  *116.35  *46 pct *117.67 *117.58</p>
<p>------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET---------Aug 11------------</p>
<p>*Techs see consolidation in new lower range for dollar/mark between 1.8380-1.8650, dollar/yen between 114.20-117.00.</p>
<p>*Break of Friday's lows seen opening door for lower ranges.</p>
<p>*Talk of medium-term dollar top cited, but Friday's collapse still seen as correction in longer-term uptrend.</p>
<p>*Dlr overbought on intraday basis, day's tops already seen set. Dlr/mark break of 1.8650 needed for upside resumption.</p>
</text>
